---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Reformed Church Maui | Maui OPC"
  description="Looking for a Reformed church on Maui, Hawaii? We are an OPC church plant — the first confessional Reformed congregation on the island."
  canonical="https://reformedchurchmaui.com/reformed-church-maui/"
  h1="Reformed Church on Maui, Hawaii"
  breadcrumb={[{ name: 'Reformed Church Maui', url: 'https://reformedchurchmaui.com/reformed-church-maui/' }]}
>
  <p class="text-[#5F5E5A] text-base leading-relaxed mb-10">
    If you've been searching for a Reformed church on Maui, you've found the right place. We are planting the first confessional Reformed congregation on the island — a mission work of the Orthodox Presbyterian Church.
  </p>

  <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-[#1E2A3A] mt-10 mb-4">What makes a church Reformed?</h2>
  <p class="text-[#5F5E5A] leading-relaxed mb-8">
    A Reformed church holds to the historic Protestant confessions — in our case the Westminster Confession of Faith. Reformed churches believe in the sovereignty of God in salvation, the authority of Scripture alone, and worship shaped by the Bible rather than by cultural preference. If you've come from a Reformed Baptist, PCA, OPC, or similar background, you'll recognize what we're building.
  </p>

  <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-[#1E2A3A] mt-10 mb-4">Why Maui needs a Reformed church</h2>
  <p class="text-[#5F5E5A] leading-relaxed mb-8">
    Maui has evangelical churches, Catholic parishes, and mainline congregations — but no confessional Reformed church. For Reformed Christians living on or moving to Maui, the nearest OPC congregation has been on Oahu. We're here to change that.
  </p>

  <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-[#1E2A3A] mt-10 mb-4">Who we are</h2>
  <p class="text-[#5F5E5A] leading-relaxed mb-12">
    We are a mission work of the Orthodox Presbyterian Church, currently in the church plant phase. Services have not yet begun. We're gathering a community of people interested in Reformed worship on Maui and will announce our launch date by email.
  </p>

  <div class="border-t border-[#D3D1C7] pt-10 space-y-4">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
      <a href="/connect/" class="inline-block bg-[#C4A35A] text-[#1E2A3A] font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded hover:bg-[#d4b36a] transition-colors">
        Get connected &rarr;
      </a>
      <a href="/what-we-believe/" class="inline-block border border-[#1E2A3A] text-[#1E2A3A] font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded hover:bg-[#1E2A3A]/5 transition-colors">
        What we believe
      </a>
      <a href="/presbyterian-church-maui/" class="inline-block border border-[#1E2A3A] text-[#1E2A3A] font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded hover:bg-[#1E2A3A]/5 transition-colors">
        Presbyterian Church Maui
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
